  1→# live-verdict-screenshot-check - Test Specification v4
       2→
       3→## 1. Overview
       4→
       5→This test specification covers the live-verdict-screenshot-check sub-feature for the snake game, ensuring tests don't get falsely marked as failed due to infrastructure timeouts, and providing E2E screenshot proof of game functionality.
       6→
       7→## 2. Unit Test Coverage
       8→
       9→### 2.1 snake/internal/food Package
      10→
      11→| Test | Description | Expected Result |
      12→|------|-------------|-----------------|
